import{_ as e,o as t,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 639 | Time-Domain Philosophy | Philosophical Construction of the Symbiotic Faction's Time-View","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 639 | Time-Domain Philosophy | Philosophical Construction of the Symbiotic Faction's Time-View","no":639,"module":3,"tags":["Time-Domain Philosophy","Symbiotic Faction","Time-View Construction","Myriad-Race Republicanism","Philosophical Construction"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","25-Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0639_模块3-时间域哲学-共生派时间观的哲学建构.md","filePath":"en/0639_模块3-时间域哲学-共生派时间观的哲学建构.md"}`),a={name:"en/0639_模块3-时间域哲学-共生派时间观的哲学建构.md"};function s(r,i,l,c,m,h){return t(),o("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-639-time-domain-philosophy-philosophical-construction-of-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view" tabindex="-1">Entry 639 | Time-Domain Philosophy | Philosophical Construction of the Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-639-time-domain-philosophy-philosophical-construction-of-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 639 | Time-Domain Philosophy | Philosophical Construction of the Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 03, 25 | Series: Time-Domain Philosophy (Entry 6)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-critique-to-construction-—-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-s-positive-manifesto" tabindex="-1">Introduction: from critique to construction — the symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view&#39;s positive manifesto <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-critique-to-construction-—-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-s-positive-manifesto" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: from critique to construction — the symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view&#39;s positive manifesto&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Entry 638 critiqued the predatory faction&#39;s time-view&#39;s four philosophical fallacies. But critique is not the endpoint; construction is. The symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view must positively answer: <strong>if time is not personal private property, what is it? If time allocation is not decided by force, by what? If time cannot be zero-sum occupied, how to let Myriad Ranks simultaneously have more time?</strong> This entry, as the symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view&#39;s positive construction, gives a systematic answer.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are not only critical weapons, but construction blueprints: anti-predation axiom defines time-resource development methods; republican axiom of Myriad Races defines time-resource allocation subjects; collective ascension axiom defines time-investment service direction; causal self-discipline axiom defines time-operation ethical boundaries; law-first axiom defines time-law self-consistency standards. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-five-core-propositions-of-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view" tabindex="-1">I. Five Core Propositions of the Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-core-propositions-of-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five Core Propositions of the Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-proposition-1-time-is-civilization-s-public-resource" tabindex="-1">1.1 Proposition 1: Time Is Civilization&#39;s Public Resource <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-proposition-1-time-is-civilization-s-public-resource" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Proposition 1: Time Is Civilization&#39;s Public Resource&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Time does not belong to any individual, but to civilization as a whole. The individual&#39;s right to use time comes from civilization&#39;s authorization, not from force. This is not a moral ideal, but a law fact — time structure is part of the law network, and the law network belongs to Myriad Ranks (Document 20 anchor structure and hierarchy).</p><h3 id="_1-2-proposition-2-time-may-be-incrementally-developed" tabindex="-1">1.2 Proposition 2: Time May Be Incrementally Developed <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-proposition-2-time-may-be-incrementally-developed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Proposition 2: Time May Be Incrementally Developed&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The predatory faction defaults time as zero-sum; occupying more means grabbing more. The symbiotic faction believes that through law-level time-flow regulation, additional time windows may be created for civilization without reducing anyone&#39;s time. The Origin Acceleration Domain is this incremental development&#39;s technological implementation — hundredfold flow is not grabbed from mortals, but incremental space created through law engineering.</p><h3 id="_1-3-proposition-3-time-allocation-by-contribution" tabindex="-1">1.3 Proposition 3: Time Allocation by Contribution <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-proposition-3-time-allocation-by-contribution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Proposition 3: Time Allocation by Contribution&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Time resources&#39; allocation is not by martial force, not by birth, not by grace, but by contribution. Contribution calculation is jointly completed by the joint-contracting mechanism (Document 22) and the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. This ensures time flows to where civilizational increment contribution is greatest, not to the strongest fist.</p><h3 id="_1-4-proposition-4-time-investment-must-feed-back" tabindex="-1">1.4 Proposition 4: Time Investment Must Feed Back <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-4-proposition-4-time-investment-must-feed-back" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.4 Proposition 4: Time Investment Must Feed Back&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Any output obtained in the time domain — gongfu, technology, Dao-realization — must feed back to the Alaya Network, network-wide shared. Privately retaining time outputs is equivalent to stealing public resources. This proposition directly binds time allocation with collective ascension axiom.</p><h3 id="_1-5-proposition-5-time-law-stable-and-self-consistent" tabindex="-1">1.5 Proposition 5: Time Law Stable and Self-Consistent <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-5-proposition-5-time-law-stable-and-self-consistent" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.5 Proposition 5: Time Law Stable and Self-Consistent&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Time&#39;s law definition — flow, allocation, switching, feedback — once legislated by the Anchor Council, never retcons, never arbitrarily changes. No plot need may kidnap time law. This is law-first axiom&#39;s direct implementation in the time domain.</p><h2 id="ii-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-time-structure-table" tabindex="-1">II. The Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View Time-Structure Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-time-structure-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View Time-Structure Table&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Time Layer</th><th>Law Position</th><th>Dominant Principle</th><th>Corresponding Axiom</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Physical Time</td><td>Material plane&#39;s basic time flow</td><td>Equal, non-compressible</td><td>Myriad-Race Republicanism</td></tr><tr><td>Acceleration Time</td><td>Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s hundredfold flow</td><td>Incremental development, feedback publicity</td><td>Anti-Predation + Collective Ascension</td></tr><tr><td>Sediment Time</td><td>Quest Sediment Domain&#39;s equal-speed immersion</td><td>Insight non-accelerable</td><td>Myriad-Race Republicanism</td></tr><tr><td>Causal Time</td><td>Cross-plane time operations&#39; reporting chain</td><td>Observe before interfere</td><td>Causal Self-Discipline</td></tr><tr><td>Law Time</td><td>The law network itself&#39;s time definition</td><td>Stable, self-consistent</td><td>Law-First</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Five-layer time structure constitutes the symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view&#39;s complete picture: each layer has a clear law position, dominant principle, and corresponding top-level axiom.</p><h2 id="iii-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-and-myriad-ranks-daily-life" tabindex="-1">III. The Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View and Myriad Ranks&#39; Daily Life <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-and-myriad-ranks-daily-life" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View and Myriad Ranks&#39; Daily Life&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view is not a lofty philosophical construction; it directly lands as Myriad Ranks&#39; daily experience:</p><ul><li>A human youth studying in Sense Origin Realm knows he may apply to the acceleration domain to deduce gongfu; outputs must feed back — this is propositions 3 and 4&#39;s daily fulfillment;</li><li>A planet consciousness in long evolution needs a sediment period to realize planetary life; the Quest Sediment Domain provides it undisturbed immersion space — this is propositions 2 and 4&#39;s landing;</li><li>An exotic beast clan choosing slow experience rather than accelerated cultivation, the Myriad-Ranks-Self-Chosen-Destiny mechanism (Entry 525) guarantees this choice — this is Proposition 1&#39;s &quot;public resource&quot; not equal to &quot;forced averaging.&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-philosophical-uniqueness" tabindex="-1">IV. The Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View Philosophical Uniqueness <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-symbiotic-faction-s-time-view-philosophical-uniqueness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Symbiotic Faction&#39;s Time-View Philosophical Uniqueness&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Compared to various historical time philosophies, the symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view has several unique features:</p><ol><li><strong>It is not pure speculation, but an engineering-implementable law system</strong> — the Origin Acceleration Domain and Quest Sediment Domain are time-philosophy&#39;s technical embodiment;</li><li><strong>It does not pursue individual immortality, but civilizational perpetuity</strong> — the time-view&#39;s service object is civilization as a whole, not the individual;</li><li><strong>It neither treats time as enemy nor as master, but as co-building material</strong> — time is neither a passage to be fought against nor an eternity to be worshipped, but a resource Myriad Ranks may jointly develop.</li></ol><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: five propositions ensure time resources not wasted on individual inflation; every bit of time investment points to civilizational increment</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: propositions 1, 3, 4 directly cut three time-plunder paths — negate time privacy, negate force allocation, force feedback publicity</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s time-view is &quot;strong-private + grace-distribution&quot;; the symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view is &quot;civilization-public + contribution-distribution&quot;; philosophical stances completely opposed</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five propositions equally apply to all beings of Myriad Ranks; time-public-resource qualification does not divide racial lineages</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: five propositions as law definitions all public; newly merged planes接入 the same time-view; the time structure leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The symbiotic faction&#39;s time-view is not the predatory faction&#39;s &quot;improved version,&quot; but from the fundamental premise redefines time. When time shifts from &quot;the strong&#39;s private property&quot; to &quot;civilization&#39;s public resource,&quot; when time allocation shifts from &quot;force decides&quot; to &quot;contribution decides,&quot; when time investment shifts from &quot;individual inflation&quot; to &quot;civilizational joint progress&quot; — the dual-track time domain is no longer a technical facility, but a brand-new civilizational time philosophy. <strong>This is one of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s most unique contributions to cosmic-civilizational thought</strong>.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">Entry 03 · Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./640_模块3-时间域哲学-时间与因果的法则网络统一.html">Entry 640 · Law-Network Unity of Time and Causality</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const p=e(a,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
